ble\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eSSC Exam Calendar 2026-2027\u003c/span\u003e : Important Question\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ1. What is the SSC Exam Calendar 2026-2027?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA:\u003c/strong\u003e The \u003cstrong\u003eSSC Exam Calendar 2026-2027\u003c/strong\u003e provides the schedule of exams conducted by the \u003cstrong\u003eStaff Selection Commission (SSC)\u003c/strong\u003e for \u003cstrong\u003evarious posts\u003c/strong\u003e, including application start and end dates, examination dates, and result timelines.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ3. What are the key exams listed in the SSC Exam Calendar 2026-2027?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA:\u003c/strong\u003e The key exams include:\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"list-style-type: none;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSC Combined Graduate Level (CGL) Exam\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSC Combined Higher Secondary Level (CHSL) Exam\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSC Multi-Tasking Staff (MTS) Exam\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSC Junior Engineer (JE) Exam\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSC Stenographer Grade C \u0026amp; D Exam\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSC GD Constable Exam\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSC Selection Posts\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ2. Where can I download the SSC Exam Calendar 2026-2027?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA:\u003c/strong\u003e The SSC Exam Calendar can be downloaded from the official \u003cstrong\u003eSSC website\u003c/strong\u003e at \u003ca target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003essc.nic.in\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-28475\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/SSC-Exam-Calendar-2025-26-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"SSC Exam Calendar 2026-27\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/SSC-Exam-Calendar-2025-26-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/SSC-Exam-Calendar-2025-26-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/SSC-Exam-Calendar-2025-26-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/SSC-Exam-Calend